82","title":"Give residents notice of Medicaid/Medicare coverage and potential liability for services not covered.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0688":{"code":"F-0688","title":"Provide appropriate care for a resident to maintain and/or improve range of motion (ROM), limited ROM and/or mobility, unless a decline is for a medical reason.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0692":{"code":"F-0692","title":"Provide enough food/fluids to maintain a resident's health.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0693":{"code":"F-0693","title":"Ensure that feeding tubes are  not used unless there is a medical reason and the resident agrees; and provide appropriate care for a resident with a feeding tube.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0695":{"code":"F-0695","title":"Provide safe and appropriate respiratory care for a resident when needed.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0699":{"code":"F-0699","title":"Provide care or services that was trauma informed and/or culturally competent.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0755":{"code":"F-0755","title":"Provide pharmaceutical services to meet the needs of each resident and employ or obtain the services of a licensed pharmacist.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0761":{"code":"F-0761","title":"Ensure drugs and biologicals used in the facility are labeled in accordance with currently accepted professional principles; and all drugs and biologicals must be stored 